    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνομ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lawlessness, lawless conduct,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικαιοσύνη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.96
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				97
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. νόμων κρατεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					1095
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀμύνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					4.1.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὀφλισκάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					443
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ αὐτονομίας . . εἰς ἀνομίας
					ἐμπίπτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					6.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.755b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆν ἐν πάσῃ ἀναρχίᾳ καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					575a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the negation of law,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.152
			</span></i>.</div>
